WEBVTT

00:03:59.726 --> 00:04:02.432
There's not even time or space.

00:04:03.214 --> 00:04:06.912
Imagine the darkest,
emptiest thing you can

00:04:06.936 --> 00:04:10.253
and cube it a gazillion times
and that's where we are.

00:04:10.732 --> 00:04:13.072
And then suddenly,

00:04:13.096 --> 00:04:14.104
bang!

00:04:14.128 --> 00:04:16.335
A universe appears, an entire universe.

00:04:16.359 --> 00:04:18.215
And we've crossed our first threshold.

00:04:18.239 --> 00:04:20.612
The universe is tiny;
it's smaller than an atom.

00:04:20.636 --> 00:04:21.976
It's incredibly hot.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:24.525
It contains everything
that's in today's universe,

00:04:24.549 --> 00:04:26.343
so you can imagine, it's busting.

00:04:26.367 --> 00:04:28.976
And it's expanding at incredible speed.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:30.913
And at first, it's just a blur,